  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "It’s hard to be the most sought-out shaman in the country. You either get dismissed as a fraud or bombarded with questions about the most mundane things. Eun-cheon doesn’t mind the job, though. The job comes with a guardian entity that keeps you loaded and protects you from demons; what's bad about that? However, an unfortunate misunderstanding drives the General away, depriving Eun-cheon of the comfy life he's gotten used to. Eun-cheon's determined to get the general back. Even if that means he has to sleep with the person who hates him the most, the Divine General’s direct descendant, Lee Do-rim. \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
